  "system": {
    "description": "<p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Witches are mediaries of magical secrets. One may become a witch through the whispers of a familiar or the favor of a being from beyond.</span></p><p><br></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Iconic Witches</strong></b></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">• Dr. Facilier, The Princess and the Frog</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">• Sabrina Spellman, Sabrina the Teenage Witch</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">• The Morrigan, Celtic mythology</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">• Yubaba, Spirited Away</span></p><p><br></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Playing Witch</strong></b></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">The witch is a debuffer focused on Casting Spells to stack detriments. Stick to the shadows and pile on Statuses through Hex.</span></p><p><br></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Action:</strong></b><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> Cast</span></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Move:</strong></b><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> Backline</span></p><p><br></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Training: </strong></b><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Mysticism</span></p>",
